TITLE  ARGUS corpus: esfera (Co-60)
       .
SKPAR  0              [Primary particles: 1=e-, 2=ph, 3=e+, 4=h, 5=a]
SRNUCL Co-60.nuc                                [NUCLEIDE data file]
SPOSIT 0 0 0                               [Coordinates of the source]
       .
MFNAME water.mat                      [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e4 1e3 1e4 0.05 0.05 1e4 1e3       [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MSIMPH 1e5 1e5 1e5 0.05 0.05 1e4          [EABSH(1:3),C1H,C2H,WCCH]
MSIMPN 1.0 500                                         [FNABS,FORCEN]
       .
GEOMFN esfera.geo                    [Geometry file, up to 20 chars]
       .
NBE    0 0 100                       [Energy window and no. of bins]
NBANGL 30 1               [No. of bins for the angles THETA and PHI]
       .
GRIDR  5 25                  [Radius of the dose volume, no. of bins]
       .
EPROF  mcs-null.mcs            [Cross section table, up to 20 chars]
EPROPM 2 1                           [Activating particle, material]
       .
NSIMSH 3000                    [Desired number of simulated showers]
TIME   2e9                         [Allotted simulation time, in sec]
